# atomic sandbox replay v1
# M6 bonds, labels and isotopes on the water preset (Task 10's script): two O-H bonds read off
# this step's density (fresh, not an earlier step's) and the label "H2O - water"; select an H
# (nucleus 1) and make it 2H: the mass changes, the surface does not, so the bonds and the formula
# stay. (Relax is relax_h2's and the tools suite's: relaxing water here took about a minute, to the
# nearly linear minimum the smeared oxygen gives at h = sigma = 0.25 - see the h2o preset's note.)
view 1400 900
action smooth-motion false
# pinned at the merge of main (2026-10-14): written for the presets' own 49^3 x 0.25 grid (Balanced)
# without container walls, before the app defaulted to Accurate (81^3) with walls on
action quality balanced
action walls off 4.5
action preset h2o
wait idle
expect bonds 2
expect bonds-stale false
expect molecule 0 H2O
action tool select
t 100 cursor 0.1967989 -0.1277001
t 110 button left down
t 170 button left up
expect selected 1
action isotope 1 2
wait idle
expect isotope 1 2
expect bonds 2
expect bonds-stale false
expect molecule 0 H2O
expect no-error
